Austin Ferro PhD

About me:

I am a senior postdoctoral fellow in Dr. Lucas Cheadle's lab with joint appointments at CSHL and HHMI. 
I motivated neuroscientist with expertise in various imaging modailities including single and multiphoton imaging as well as electron microscopy, glia, and neurodevelopmental/ neurodegenerative diseases.  



